---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Form from '../components/Form.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Free AI Visibility Audit"
  description="Request a free branded AI visibility audit for your dental implant clinic. No call required. We’ll look at crawler access, whether test prompts mention you, and the top fixes."
  path="/free-audit/"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Lead magnet"
    title="Get your free AI visibility audit."
    lead="Send the clinic website and the best email to reach the principal or practice manager. We’ll return a branded PDF. No call, and no obligation to buy a plan."
    crumbs={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { href: '/free-audit/', label: 'Free audit' }]}
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap page-grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>What’s in the PDF</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>A technical score for crawler access, schema and basic on-page structure</li>
          <li>Whether named AI tools mention the clinic in dated test prompts for your suburb</li>
          <li>The top fixes, written in plain language</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The audit is a snapshot of those test runs, not a prediction and not a guarantee that a tool will name you tomorrow. If you then want a first fix, the <a href="/ai-visibility/fix-sprint/">$1,495 Fix Sprint</a> is the next step, and that fee is credited toward setup if you move onto a plan.</p>
        <p>Prefer email? Write to <a href="mailto:jcheng@hero.tt">jcheng@hero.tt</a> with your URL.</p>
      </div>
      <Form type="free-audit" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
